      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I work as a dealer of information. I sell important info and buy charts, documents and lab records. My information is valuable and very useful to the one who possesses it!",
      "JA_current": "俺は情報屋だ。耳寄りなネタを売っちゃ、地図や機密文書、研究所の記録を買い取ってる。俺の握る情報は価値があるぜ。持ってる奴にとっちゃ命綱にもなる代物だ！",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
