      "source_xml_line": 902,
      "string_id": "bar_bar_osvedomitel_start_21",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Hello, Marked One. You helped Freedom and made the right choice. Your fate is now tied with that of Freedom and Duty has you in its sights. I'd suggest you go to the abandoned military base and join Freedom - they need good fighters.",
      "JA_current": "よう、マークド・ワン。フリーダムに肩入れしたそうじゃないか。いい判断だったな。今やお前とフリーダムは一蓮托生、デューティーの連中にはガッツリ狙われてるぞ。どうだ、放棄された軍事基地へ行ってフリーダムに入隊しちゃみないか？ 腕の立つ兵隊を欲しがってるぜ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "bar_bar_osvedomitel_start",
